{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-header",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": { "x": 20, "y": -220 },
      "data": {
        "label": "Sinnamary RF Pixel Classification — Phase 3",
        "params": {
          "text": "# Sinnamary RF Pixel Classification — Phase 3\n\n**Goal:** Supervised pixel classification of the Sinnamary coast using a **Random Forest** trained on the 12-band S1+S2 fused stack with **ESA WorldCover 2021** as ground truth labels.\n\n## Pipeline\n🟦 **Left — Feature engineering (S1+S2):** 12-band stack — 6 S1 polarization features + 3 S1 passthrough (VV, VH, VV_VH_ratio) + NDVI + MNDWI + EVI.\n🟩 **Center — Ground truth:** ESA WorldCover 2021 (10 m → 20 m) — Mangroves (95), Herbaceous wetland (90), Trees (10), Water (80), Bare/orpaillage (60).\n🟧 **Right — geo_rf_classifier:** Stratified sampling per class (max 5 000 px/class), RF 100 trees, 20 % hold-out test set. Predicts every pixel in the AOI.\n\n## Expected outputs\n- Classification map: 5 classes colorized\n- Confidence map (per-pixel max probability)\n- Feature importance bar chart: which band drives the model most\n- Test accuracy logged to engine console\n\n## Class palette (WorldCover)\n| Value | Class | Color |\n|-------|-------|-------|\n| 95 | Mangroves | dark green |\n| 90 | Herbaceous wetland | teal |\n| 10 | Tree cover | green |\n| 80 | Permanent water | blue |\n| 60 | Bare/sparse (orpaillage) | tan |",
          "width": 2060,
          "height": 300,
          "fontSize": 13,
          "color_index": 4
        }
      },
      "width": 2060,
      "height": 300
    },

    {
      "id": "frame-s1",
      "type": "canvas_frame",
      "position": { "x": 20, "y": 120 },
      "style": { "width": 440, "height": 740, "zIndex": -1 },
      "data": { "label": "Frame", "params": { "color_index": 2, "title": "1 · S1 RTC feature engineering" } },
