          { "id": "image__1_confidence", "color": "image", "label": "Confidence" },
          { "id": "image__2_importance", "color": "image", "label": "Feature Importance" },
          { "id": "image__3_full_report","color": "image", "label": "Fig 5 — Full report" },
          { "id": "image__4_confmat",    "color": "image", "label": "CM preview" },
          { "id": "image__5_s1context",  "color": "image", "label": "S1 context RGB" }
        ],
        "minified": false
      },
      "width": 1400, "height": 240
    },

    {
      "id": "frame-validation",
      "type": "canvas_frame",
      "position": { "x": 20, "y": 1340 },
      "style": { "width": 2060, "height": 480, "zIndex": -1 },
      "data": { "label": "Frame", "params": { "color_index": 3, "title": "7 · Independent validation — MapBiomas cross-check (Fig 6)" } },
      "width": 2060, "height": 480
    },

    {
      "id": "n-mapbiomas",
      "type": "geo_mapbiomas",
      "position": { "x": 40, "y": 1420 },
      "data": {
        "params": {
          "node_note": "**MapBiomas Amazônia 2023** — independent reference map for cross-validation. Classes: 3=Forest, 6=Flooded Forest, 11=Wetland, 25=Bare, 30=Mining, 33=Water, 41=Mangrove. NOT derived from WorldCover → fully independent accuracy assessment.",
          "bbox": "-53.30,4.40,-52.60,5.50",
          "year": 2023,
          "collection": 0,
          "resolution": 30,
          "timeout": 120,
          "fetch": 0
        }
      },
      "width": 420, "height": 280
    },

    {
      "id": "n-agreement",
      "type": "geo_map_agreement",
      "position": { "x": 520, "y": 1420 },
      "data": {
        "params": {
          "node_note": "**RF vs MapBiomas agreement.** WorldCover→common: 10=1,60=4,80=2,90=3,95=5. MapBiomas→common: 3=1,6=1,11=3,25=4,30=4,33=2,41=5. Common: 1=Forest, 2=Water, 3=Wetland, 4=Bare, 5=Mangrove. Outputs Cohen's κ + per-class agreement bar chart (Fig 6).",
          "pred_mapping": "10=1,60=4,80=2,90=3,95=5",
          "ref_mapping": "3=1,6=1,11=3,25=4,30=4,33=2,41=5",
          "common_labels": "1=Forest,2=Water,3=Wetland,4=Bare,5=Mangrove",
          "dpi": 110
        }
      },
      "width": 480, "height": 280
    },

    {
      "id": "note-validation",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": { "x": 1060, "y": 1420 },
      "data": {
        "label": "Class mapping — WorldCover → MapBiomas",
        "params": {
          "text": "## Class mapping — WorldCover → reference\n\n### MapBiomas Amazônia (preferred)\n`ref_mapping = 3=1,6=1,11=3,25=4,30=4,33=2,41=5`\n\n| Common | WorldCover | MapBiomas |\n|--------|-----------|----------|\n| **5 Mangrove** | 95 | **41** ✓ |\n| **2 Water** | 80 | 33 |\n| **3 Wetland** | 90 | 11 |\n| **1 Forest** | 10 | 3 + 6 |\n| **4 Bare** | 60 | 25 + 30 |\n\n### IO-LULC fallback (if MapBiomas unavailable)\n`ref_mapping = 2=1,1=2,4=3,8=4` — **no specific Mangrove class** (class 4 = Flooded veg covers mangroves + wetland). Collapse pred_mapping to 4 classes: `10=1,80=2,90=3,95=3,60=4`\n\n**Target (paper):** κ ≥ 0.70 overall, agreement ≥ 0.80 on Mangrove (MapBiomas only).",
          "width": 520,
          "height": 260,
          "fontSize": 11,
          "color_index": 3
        }
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260
    },

    {
      "id": "n-display-val",
      "type": "output_display",
      "position": { "x": 1640, "y": 1420 },
      "data": {
        "params": {
          "node_note": "**Validation outputs.** Agreement map + Fig 6 (kappa + per-class bar) + MapBiomas preview."
        },
